# YAML compatibility module
# Provides service_yaml.c — legacy parser for .yaml / .yml unit files.
# TOML (src/service_toml.c) is the native format; this module is kept for
# backward compatibility with pre-TOML service definitions.
# Sources are consumed by the root meson.build via yaml_module_sources.
